}
q4: "Elke .And op hetzelfde subject?" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: continues on another subject\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q5: "Subject veilig twee keer te evalueren?" {shape: diamond}
m5: "Hoist: var subject = x;\n(proofs: subject-call, subject-indexer,\nsubject-call-twice)"
q6: "Elke schakel gevonden door een patroon?" {shape: diamond}
m6: "Manual: which no pattern rewrites\n(proof: unsupported-link)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q7: "Elke schakel Fixed?" {shape: diamond}
m7: "Manual: Link <naam> of the .And chain: <reden>\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
fx: "Fixed: één Shouldly-statement per schakel\n(simple, because, three-links, be-of-type,\nmember-subject, nullable, edge-multiline,\nbe-same-as, dates, equivalent-collection, ...)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
